leven willen geven.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN; oorspronkelijke gecontroleerde samenvatting","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1721715/things-we-hide-from-the-light.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00Z","review_batch":"nl006-reviewed-batch-01-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1721715/things-we-hide-from-the-light.html","sha256":"cde51a5b98411ee15179903ed93ff61f2868cfde3f67a0685afe12d022ce13e2","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T13:14:33.185Z","fact":"Paperback ISBN 9789020553703 verschijningsdatum 24/01/2024 NUR 302 Vertaalde literaire roman, novelle imprint Z&K uitgever VBK Media taal Nederlands","sourceAuthors":"Lucy Score","identityNote":"Same canonical Work, translation attached to existing identity; no author/Work merge."}]}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789021498409","key":{"edition_id":977200008},"before":null,"after":{"edition_id":977200008,"work_id":977100004,"bound_author_id":924300405,"bound_title":"King of Sloth","bound_language":"dut","bound_isbn13":"9789021498409","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000717953_King_of_sloth_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1963438/king-of-sloth.html","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00Z","review_batch":"nl006-reviewed-batch-01-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1963438/king-of-sloth.html","sha256":"ef3dea621e837a093dbdf0b9e3fb49704df731e4097cfcee960310d606e988d9","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T13:15:07.779Z","fact":"Paperback ISBN 9789021498409 verschijningsdatum 10/07/2025 NUR 343 Romantiek imprint Love Books uitgever Singel Uitgeverijen taal Nederlands","sourceAuthors":"Ana Huang","identityNote":"Same canonical Work, translation attached to existing identity; no author/Work merge."},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000717953_King_of_sloth_0_0.jpg","sha256":"5fdeaae11051090294523dd6f305fbc87e6522640dc949aa5afa2559bf7536a5","bytes":451988,"checkedAt":"2026-11-01T13:17:01.349Z","fact":"Exact ISBN block image + human visual title/author review, sheet1"}]}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:1998","key":{"work_id":977100004,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":977100004,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":924300405,"text":"Xavier Castillo heeft geld, charme en weinig belangstelling voor de verwachtingen van zijn familie. Zijn pr-manager Sloane Kensington is juist ambitieus en laat zich niet gemakkelijk afleiden van haar werk. Zijn plagerijen maken hun samenwerking er niet eenvoudiger op. Wanneer Xaviers toekomst minder vanzelfsprekend wordt, verandert ook de betekenis van hun onderlinge contact. Sloane moet haar professionele grenzen bewaken tegenover iemand die gewend is zijn zin te krijgen.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN; oorspronkelijke gecontroleerde samenvatting","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1963438/king-of-sloth.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00Z","review_batch":"nl006-reviewed-batch-01-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1963438/king-of-sloth.html","sha256":"ef3dea621e837a093dbdf0b9e3fb49704df731e4097cfcee960310d606e988d9","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T13:15:07.779Z","fact":"Paperback ISBN 9789021498409 verschijningsdatum 10/07/2025 NUR 343 Romantiek imprint Love Books uitgever Singel Uitgeverijen taal Nederlands","sourceAuthors":"Ana Huang","identityNote":"Same canonical Work, translation attached to existing identity; no author/Work merge."}]}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789464820904","key":{"edition_id":977200010},"before":null,"after":{"edition_id":977200010,"work_id":977100005,"bound_author_id":975300002,"bound_title":"Feilloos","bound_language":"dut","bound_isbn13":"9789464820904","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000614500_Feilloos_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1762445/feilloos.html","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00Z","review_batch":"nl006-reviewed-batch-01-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1762445/feilloos.html","sha256":"e9813460312d4be051f2a32a3daad79798e2994376fa1681d5728bc72efa2ab8","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T13:15:09.976Z","fact":"Paperback ISBN 9789464820904 verschijningsdatum 01/03/2024 NUR 343 Romantiek imprint April Books uitgever April Books taal Nederlands","sourceAuthors":"Elsie Silver","identityNote":"Same canonical Work, translation attached to existing identity; no author/Work merge."},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000614500_Feilloos_0_0.jpg","sha256":"8a569911d335be67285602bd37ae9cd1db84d1a8b4e0f1164c1c1e78376feedd","bytes":167176,"checkedAt":"2026-11-01T13:17:03.296Z","fact":"Exact ISBN block image + human visual title/author review, sheet1"}]}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:2002","key":{"work_id":977100005,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":977100005,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":975300002,"text":"Stierenrijder Rhett Eaton brengt met een ondoordachte uitspraak zijn sponsors in verlegenheid. Zijn agent wil verdere problemen voorkomen en stuurt dochter Summer met hem mee tijdens de laatste maanden van zijn tour. Summer wil laten zien dat ze haar werk aankan, terwijl Rhett weinig behoefte heeft aan toezicht. De voortdurende nabijheid maakt hun botsende verwachtingen persoonlijker en zet de grenzen tussen hun opdracht en hun gevoelens onder druk.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN; oorspronkelijke gecontroleerde samenvatting","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1762445/feilloos.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T14:24:00Z","review_batch":"nl006-reviewed-batch-01-20